// Same rules as those: only on the 茵菲谷 map after the welcome; `farmIf` keeps a card to farms that have the thing
// (crop growing, chicken/sheep/cow, a tree); effects are the ones spring_story.applyFarm / infei_farm.applyMore know.
// Season-neutral on purpose (no blossoms, fireflies, watermelon or snow), so every card fits every season.
